swer":94.1578,"unit":"mV","tolerance":0.02,"explanation":"Assuming saturation gives \\(I_D = 250\\ \\mu\\mathrm{A}\\) and \\(V_{out} = 1.8 - 5 = -3.2\\ \\mathrm{V}\\), impossible, so the device is in triode: \\(1.8 - V = 20\\ \\mathrm{k\\Omega}\\cdot2\\ \\mathrm{mA/V^2}(0.5 - V/2)V\\), i.e. \\(20V^2 - 21V + 1.8 = 0\\), giving \\(V \\approx 94\\ \\mathrm{mV}\\).","figure":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 210\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Common-source DC transfer curve: output stays at V_DD until the input reaches V_T, falls steeply while the transistor is saturated, then flattens toward zero once it enters triode.\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" style=\"max-width:340px;width:100%;height:auto\"><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"176\"/><polygon points=\"330,176 323.6,178.7 323.6,173.3\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"16\"/><polygon points=\"50,16 52.7,22.4 47.3,22.4\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">V_in (V)</text><text x=\"54\" y=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">V_out (V)</text><polyline points=\"50,41 52.2,41 54.5,41 56.8,41 59,41 61.2,41 63.5,41 65.8,41 68,41 70.2,41 72.5,41 74.8,41 77,41 79.2,41 81.5,41 83.8,41 86,41 88.2,41 90.5,41 92.8,41 95,41 97.2,41 99.5,41 101.8,41 104,41 106.2,41 108.5,41 110.8,41 113,41.2 115.2,41.5 117.5,41.9 119.8,42.6 122,43.4 124.2,44.4 126.5,45.5 128.8,46.9 131,48.3 133.2,50 135.5,51.8 137.8,53.8 140,56 142.2,58.3 144.5,60.8 146.8,63.5 149,66.4 151.2,69.4 153.5,72.5 155.8,75.9 158,79.4 160.2,83.1 162.5,86.9 164.8,91 167,95.1 169.2,99.5 171.5,104 173.8,108.7 176,113.6 178.2,118.6 180.5,123.8 182.8,129.2 185,134.8 187.2,140 189.5,143.2 191.8,145.4 194,147.1 196.2,148.6 198.5,149.8 200.8,150.9 203,151.8 205.2,